python3 (3.14.7-2) stable; urgency=medium

  * V2 release for jailbroken iOS arm64.
  * Upgrade to the current Python 3.14.7 feature release.
  * Update OpenSSL to 3.6.4 and libffi to 3.8.0.
  * Verify all downloaded source archives with SHA-256 checksums.
  * Make toolchain selection, staging, and package creation reproducible.
  * Remove obsolete configure patches and unused vendored config scripts.

